<title>JAPAN: Sekisui Chemical -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui Chemical -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.18 trln	 vs	    1.08 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   60.45		vs	   50.31</p>
<p> Current	     54.86		vs	   51.40</p>
<p> Net		   31.04		vs	   26.17</p>
